# Transient git worktrees created for isolated subagent runs. Ephemeral by
# design and auto-removed when the agent finishes; a full repo copy each, so
# committing them would add megabytes of duplicate source per run.
# NOTE: only the worktrees path is ignored. .claude/ itself may legitimately
# carry committed project settings, skills and agent definitions.
.claude/worktrees/
eir-api/cp.txt
